      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "守护着挪德卡莱的自由与和平的古老组织…"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/02/01/326985891/915e8824b84ccd96d3bdeb7d3c4f7578_9088301826491571036.png",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffd780>2025年4月27日</color>\n长久以来对抗着深渊永无休止的入侵与狂猎，守护着挪德卡莱的自由与和平的古老组织，已在过去的大战中元气大伤。面对着新的威胁，新一代的执灯士们是否还能完成自己的使命…"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "人物关系"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 8929,
        "name": "索洛维",
        "desc": "<p>初代铸灯者，也是执灯人的创立者。他的全名是西尔维斯特·索洛维。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/02/19/326985891/044c501b786bd800b77c9f4c8f342bb7_9218584962701981827.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "初代铸灯者，来自至冬的执灯人创立者，也是初代执灯长。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 8924,
        "name": "爱依菈",
        "desc": "<p>生活于500年前，「霜月之子」最初的咏月使。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/01/31/326985891/c414e4ed94fae43ea026ca79a1796389_3864898858451478478.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7622,
        "name": "霜月之子",
        "desc": "<p>传说中黄金国的遗胤，在抛弃旧日的文明后，选择了在山林之间的生活。他们所唯一不曾抛舍的，只有对「月神」的信仰。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/01/21/326985891/495bf3319bc3e1faf3bafaa0ee422e48_2332733928079429057.png",
        "displayStyle": "text",
        "menuId": 23
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "最初的咏月使，曾将能净化深渊能量的「德肋庇革劳诺之箭」赠予索洛维。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "著名执灯人"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "尼基塔\n执灯人的执灯长，也是叶洛亚的养父。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 8550,
        "name": "西格德",
        "desc": "",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2025/09/01/c9ca6be07ad8bd737297723b34f7910d_3878710260738765674.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 7
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "惯用长剑的传奇执灯长，压制魔物的技巧独一无二。他在大战之后失踪，于是为他立了一座空墓。\n索西\n军士长，被",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7486,
        "name": "雷利尔",
        "desc": "<p>坎瑞亚的「五大罪人」之一的「猎月人」。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/07/30/317661877/513d51e0ebfd54f5da34a9f85dfaf61f_4832351277427806587.png",
        "displayStyle": "text",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "所杀。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 8398,
        "name": "菲林斯",
        "desc": "挪德卡莱的「执灯人」，看守着北方小岛上的灯塔与墓地。一位言行举止极富修养的神秘绅士。",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2025/09/26/4ac47a285a0abaada08f3216bdd22b0e_7846853832529267058.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 2
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "一位为了解人类而变成执灯士的妖精。他在很久以前一座后来变成终夜长茔的小岛上，被一群执灯士唤醒。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 9123,
        "name": "叶洛亚",
        "desc": "调查分队「魇夜之莺」成员，执灯人最年轻的分队长。",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2026/01/29/d585407867aa47b4d925613cea9f00c2_5864597966579326880.png",
